OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal as dead dog found in
OL,4,A'suspicious' circumstances
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a dog has been found in
OL,7,F"suspicious circumstances" on the
OL,8,Fborder between Wales and England.
OL,10,FThe RSPCA has launched an appeal after
OL,11,Fthe discovery of the black lurcher on
OL,12,FMoor Lane, Kinnerton, near Buckley, in
OL,13,FFlintshire, on Wednesday at 09:30 BST.
OL,15,FThe charity said the dog appeared to
OL,16,Fhave been dumped.
OL,18,FIt added the male animal was chipped
OL,19,Fand wearing a black collar with metal
OL,20,Fbone-shaped studs and a blank nametag,
OL,21,Falong with some blue rope.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
